# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A QCSC workflow runs a QPU and an HPC system as one machine.\n"
"[QCSC-Prefect](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qcsc-prefect) runs QCSC workflows on\n"
"[Prefect](https://www.prefect.io/) and keeps them traceable, configurable, and resumable.\n"
msgstr ""
"Um fluxo de trabalho QCSC executa uma QPU e um sistema HPC como uma única máquina.\n"
"O [QCSC-Prefect](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qcsc-prefect) executa fluxos de trabalho QCSC no\n"
"[Prefect](https://www.prefect.io/) e os mantém rastreáveis, configuráveis e retomáveis.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This tutorial demonstrates these features with sample-based quantum diagonalization (SQD) of the N$_2$ molecule. The [Quantum Resource Management Interface (QRMI)](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qrmi) samples the circuit inside a [Slurm](https://slurm.schedmd.com/) job. The\n"
"[Fulqrum](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-fulqrum) eigensolver diagonalizes the sampled\n"
"subspaces in more Slurm jobs. One [Prefect Cloud](https://www.prefect.io/cloud) deployment runs both.\n"
msgstr ""
"Este tutorial demonstra esses recursos com a diagonalização quântica baseada em amostras (SQD) da molécula de N$_2$. A [Quantum Resource Management Interface (QRMI)](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qrmi) amostra o circuito dentro de um job do [Slurm](https://slurm.schedmd.com/). O\n"
"autorresolvedor [Fulqrum](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-fulqrum) diagonaliza os subespaços amostrados\n"
"em mais jobs do Slurm. Um único deployment do [Prefect Cloud](https://www.prefect.io/cloud) executa ambos.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "QCSC-Prefect also runs large QCSC workloads, as in the following projects.\n"
msgstr "O QCSC-Prefect também executa grandes cargas de trabalho QCSC, como nos projetos a seguir.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A study of protein-ligand complexes with more than 12,000 atoms used QCSC-Prefect. It\n"
"sampled quantum-embedding fragments on two 156-qubit IBM Quantum processors, with up to 94\n"
"qubits, and diagonalized the fragment subspaces on the Fugaku, Miyabi-G, and ROQUO\n"
"supercomputers [\\[1\\]](#references).\n"
msgstr ""
"Um estudo de complexos proteína-ligante com mais de 12.000 átomos usou o QCSC-Prefect. Ele\n"
"amostrou fragmentos de quantum embedding em dois processadores IBM Quantum de 156 qubits, com até 94\n"
"qubits, e diagonalizou os subespaços dos fragmentos nos supercomputadores Fugaku, Miyabi-G e ROQUO\n"
"[\\[1\\]](#references).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A study of iron-sulfur clusters ran an extended QCSC-Prefect SQD workflow with 36 orbitals\n"
"(72 qubits) and subspace dimensions up to $3 \\times 10^{10}$ on the Fugaku, Miyabi, and\n"
"ROQUO supercomputers [\\[2\\]](#references).\n"
msgstr ""
"Um estudo de clusters de ferro-enxofre executou um fluxo de trabalho SQD estendido do QCSC-Prefect com 36 orbitais\n"
"(72 qubits) e dimensões de subespaço de até $3 \\times 10^{10}$ nos supercomputadores Fugaku, Miyabi e\n"
"ROQUO [\\[2\\]](#references).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "The challenge of QCSC workflows {#the-challenge-of-qcsc-workflows}"
msgstr "O desafio dos fluxos de trabalho QCSC {#the-challenge-of-qcsc-workflows}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The SQD workflow is typical of QCSC workloads. QCSC-Prefect answers each of its challenges\n"
"with one feature, as in the following table.\n"
msgstr ""
"O fluxo de trabalho SQD é típico das cargas de trabalho QCSC. O QCSC-Prefect responde a cada um de seus desafios\n"
"com um recurso, como na tabela a seguir.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Challenge | QCSC-Prefect feature |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| It spans several resources. A Slurm job holds the QPU, then many Slurm jobs diagonalize subspaces, round after round. | Traceable workflow |\n"
"| It has many parameters at different levels (science, circuit, and cluster), and credentials must stay out of all of them. | Configurable parameters |\n"
"| It is long and can fail anywhere, from a walltime limit, a node failure, or a long QPU queue. Without care, a late failure means sampling on the QPU again. | Resumable execution |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Desafio | Recurso do QCSC-Prefect |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| Ele abrange vários recursos. Um job do Slurm reserva a QPU, depois muitos jobs do Slurm diagonalizam subespaços, rodada após rodada. | Fluxo de trabalho rastreável |\n"
"| Ele tem muitos parâmetros em diferentes níveis (ciência, circuito e cluster), e as credenciais devem ficar fora de todos eles. | Parâmetros configuráveis |\n"
"| Ele é longo e pode falhar em qualquer ponto, por limite de tempo, falha de nó ou uma longa fila da QPU. Sem cuidado, uma falha tardia significa amostrar na QPU de novo. | Execução retomável |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each step of [Qiskit Pattern in QCSC-Prefect step by step](#qiskit-pattern-in-qcsc-prefect-step-by-step) ends with a box that shows how QCSC-Prefect traces, configures, and resumes that stage.\n"
msgstr "Cada etapa de [Padrão Qiskit no QCSC-Prefect passo a passo](#qiskit-pattern-in-qcsc-prefect-step-by-step) termina com uma caixa que mostra como o QCSC-Prefect rastreia, configura e retoma essa etapa.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Traceable workflow {#traceable-workflow}"
msgstr "Fluxo de trabalho rastreável {#traceable-workflow}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A Prefect *flow* is a Python function made of *tasks*. QCSC-Prefect makes each stage of a\n"
"[Qiskit pattern](/guides/intro-to-patterns) (**Map**, **Optimize**, **Execute**, and **Postprocess**) one task. For every run, Prefect Cloud shows the following information:\n"
msgstr ""
"Um *flow* do Prefect é uma função Python feita de *tasks*. O QCSC-Prefect faz de cada etapa de um\n"
"[padrão Qiskit](/guides/intro-to-patterns) (**Map**, **Optimize**, **Execute** e **Postprocess**) uma tarefa. Para cada execução, o Prefect Cloud mostra as seguintes informações:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The task graph, with an arrow wherever one task passes its result to another.\n"
msgstr "O grafo de tarefas, com uma seta sempre que uma tarefa passa seu resultado para outra.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The state, inputs, logs, and duration of each task, filterable by the stage tags `map`, `optimize`, `execute`, and `post-process`.\n"
msgstr "O estado, as entradas, os logs e a duração de cada tarefa, filtráveis pelas tags de etapa `map`, `optimize`, `execute` e `post-process`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The *artifacts*, which are tables and links that tasks publish, such as the source of the\n"
"samples or the energy of each subspace.\n"
msgstr ""
"Os *artefatos*, que são tabelas e links que as tarefas publicam, como a origem das\n"
"amostras ou a energia de cada subespaço.\n"

