"any key in your file overrides it. The commented `[sqd_advanced]` table sets the\n"
"`sqd-advanced-settings` block, the commented `[advanced]` table sets block names and timeouts,\n"
"and the table of each solver holds its tuning. To choose the nodes, ranks, and threads of the solver jobs, see\n"
"[Size the SQD diagonalization for your HPC resources](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qcsc-prefect/tutorials/configure_sqd_solver_resources/).\n"
msgstr ""
