msgstr "Qiskit Pattern no QCSC-Prefect passo a passo {#qiskit-pattern-in-qcsc-prefect-step-by-step}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following steps compute the four stages in this notebook with [PySCF](https://pyscf.org/), [ffsim](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/), Qiskit, Qiskit Runtime, and [`qiskit-addon-sqd`](/addons/qiskit-addon-sqd), without Prefect. See the [SQD tutorial](/tutorials/sample-based-quantum-diagonalization) for the details of each computation.\n"
msgstr "Os passos a seguir calculam as quatro etapas deste notebook com [PySCF](https://pyscf.org/), [ffsim](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/), Qiskit, Qiskit Runtime e [`qiskit-addon-sqd`](/addons/qiskit-addon-sqd), sem o Prefect. Veja o [tutorial de SQD](/tutorials/sample-based-quantum-diagonalization) para os detalhes de cada cálculo.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Map classical inputs to a quantum problem {#step-1-map-classical-inputs-to-a-quantum-problem}"
msgstr "Passo 1: Mapear entradas clássicas para um problema quântico {#step-1-map-classical-inputs-to-a-quantum-problem}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Map stage, the task `compute_molecular_integrals` in the workflow, turns the molecule into the inputs of all later stages. Restricted Hartree-Fock (RHF) gives the molecular orbitals, and the active-space integrals leave out the two frozen 1s cores. CCSD gives the $t_2$ amplitudes of the ansatz, and its density matrix gives the orbital occupancies that start configuration recovery. CCSD iterates `CCSD_MAXITER` times, each time from the previous amplitudes, so the result does not depend on the DIIS history of the first iteration. This notebook uses 4 iterations, and the workflow uses 10.\n"
msgstr "A etapa Map, a tarefa `compute_molecular_integrals` no workflow, transforma a molécula nas entradas de todas as etapas seguintes. O Hartree-Fock restrito (RHF) fornece os orbitais moleculares, e as integrais do espaço ativo deixam de fora os dois núcleos 1s congelados. O CCSD fornece as amplitudes $t_2$ do ansatz, e sua matriz de densidade fornece as ocupações orbitais que iniciam a recuperação de configurações. O CCSD itera `CCSD_MAXITER` vezes, cada vez a partir das amplitudes anteriores, então o resultado não depende do histórico DIIS da primeira iteração. Este notebook usa 4 iterações, e o workflow usa 10.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"How QCSC-Prefect manages this step\">\n"
msgstr "<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Como o QCSC-Prefect gerencia este passo\">\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Trace:** The task `compute_molecular_integrals` has the tag `map`. Its result goes to `get_lucj_params` and `sqd_loop`, so two arrows leave it in the graph. The task logs show the PySCF output.\n"
msgstr "**Trace:** A tarefa `compute_molecular_integrals` tem a tag `map`. Seu resultado vai para `get_lucj_params` e `sqd_loop`, então duas setas saem dela no grafo. Os logs da tarefa mostram a saída do PySCF.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Configure:** The **Molecule** group of the run form selects the problem, as an FCIDUMP file or as a geometry and basis. This workflow reads `algorithms/open_loop/sqd/data/n2_631g_fc.fcidump`, which has the cores frozen already. The number of CCSD iterations (**CCSD Restarts**, 10 by default) is in the `sqd-advanced-settings` block.\n"
msgstr "**Configure:** O grupo **Molecule** do formulário de execução seleciona o problema, como um arquivo FCIDUMP ou como uma geometria e uma base. Este workflow lê `algorithms/open_loop/sqd/data/n2_631g_fc.fcidump`, que já tem os núcleos congelados. O número de iterações CCSD (**CCSD Restarts**, 10 por padrão) está no bloco `sqd-advanced-settings`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Resume:** The result is persisted (`compressed/json`), so **Retry** loads it instead of running PySCF again.\n"
msgstr "**Resume:** O resultado é persistido (`compressed/json`), então **Retry** o carrega em vez de executar o PySCF novamente.\n"

